          "kind": "dsh-plugin",
          "state": "BLOCKED"
        }
      ],
      "coverageBoundary": "CallLint does not auto-discover DeepSeek Harness configuration. Its MCP servers are plugin instances in cordis.yml rather than an mcpServers map, so no existing extractor reads that shape. This record exists for discovery routing only: DeepSeek is a model vendor here, not a security-relevant distinction."
    }
